{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-03_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-03","title":"回旋","storyCode":"3-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3be897a2bfa354f4e51599333cc6bcf977795745e4225755305e69a4f38455e5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"能天使、德克萨斯二人组在敌人阵中大闹一场，吸引了对方绝大部分的注意力。\n而另一边，罗德岛的队伍也终于赶到，投入战局——","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十五关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"该死——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人只有两个！都给我上啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么好害怕的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经损失了二十几个战士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"那两个混蛋，绝对不是什么普通人......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"小心右边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"压制住她！我来最后一击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"我暂时还抽不出手对付那个扑过来的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"下次可要请我喝冻饮哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，快点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的整合运动小哥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"这颗子弹是送给你的，请好好收下~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"子弹？子弹是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"咕......噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，替你收拾掉了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"非常感谢。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"可，可恶啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"她，她那把剑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——我平时，都是用两把的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"额，额啊！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"这下就全都解决掉啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的配合，还真是行云流水呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"别跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人的大部队赶了过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"看来是被我们闹出的动静吸引了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！！！可恶！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会.....你们，你们究竟，做了什么好事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我是和你们无仇无怨啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，合同就是合同哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"履行合同可是物流的基本行业规则呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"左边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"谢，谢谢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"那我右侧的敌人，就麻烦你解决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"跑起来吧，该转移了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":true,"text":"能天使，我们快要抵达你们所在的位置了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"现在敌人注意力都在我们俩身上，你们自己看着办！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":true,"text":"两位，注意安全！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡，你们抵达预定地点了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":true,"text":"我ok了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":true,"text":"雷蛇和其余重装干员已经就位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"全体干员注意，敌人的狙击手可能利用了地形来隐蔽自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一定要注意自己的位置，优先解决狙击手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来......大家，准备突袭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......小心目标，不要太过火了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克萨斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙兰卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]}]}
